    {
      "type": "text", "id": "arch_subtitle", "x": 72, "y": 88, "width": 1300, "height": 25,
      "text": "模块不接管账户地址或业务执行；它在 Cosmos 交易认证边界增加第二签名，并维护每个地址的 PQC 策略与密钥状态", "originalText": "模块不接管账户地址或业务执行；它在 Cosmos 交易认证边界增加第二签名，并维护每个地址的 PQC 策略与密钥状态",
      "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 400003,
