    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ante_dir_text", "x": 120, "y": 500, "width": 325, "height": 100,
      "text": "ante/  节点交易安全门\nstructure.go  extension 规范与资源上限\nverify.go       enforcement + PQC 验签\nlifecycle.go    注册/轮换/恢复 proof", "originalText": "ante/  节点交易安全门\nstructure.go  extension 规范与资源上限\nverify.go       enforcement + PQC 验签\nlifecycle.go    注册/轮换/恢复 proof",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500011,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500012, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
