    {
      "type": "text", "id": "keeper_dir_text", "x": 1245, "y": 704, "width": 360, "height": 110,
      "text": "keeper/  共识状态与业务规则\nkeeper.go          KV 读写与 effective state\nmsg_server.go   注册、轮换、恢复、治理\nquery_server.go 查询接口\ninvariants.go     状态一致性审计\nkey_history.go  历史压缩与保留", "originalText": "keeper/  共识状态与业务规则\nkeeper.go          KV 读写与 effective state\nmsg_server.go   注册、轮换、恢复、治理\nquery_server.go 查询接口\ninvariants.go     状态一致性审计\nkey_history.go  历史压缩与保留",
